abstract: "Free, open-source plane frame and truss analysis in the browser: ETABS-style grids, rigid and hinged joints, load cases with BNBC 2020 and ASCE 7-16 design combinations and envelopes, exact axial force, shear and bending moment values, deflections, reactions and a 3D view, in SI and US units."
